}+kR_{1},$ the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B.$ What are the elementary row operations?"] [:db/add "b5303979-3553-5424-8c8c-b0093f4de480" :question/worked-solution "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make the entries below $a_{12}=2$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 7 & -2 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n\\xrightarrow{R_{2}:=R_{2}+R_{1}}\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 19 & 0 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n\\xrightarrow{R_{3}:=R_{3}-4R_{1}}\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 19 & 0 & -4 \\\\ -50 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=B\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary row operations are\n\n$R_{2}:=R_{2}+R_{1}$ and $R_{3}:=R_{3}-4R_{1}$."] [:db/add "b5303979-3553-5424-8c8c-b0093f4de480" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b5303979-3553-5424-8c8c-b0093f4de480" :question/answer-fields "862808b1-124b-527e-81df-6065bd9b1508"] [:db/ensure "b5303979-3553-5424-8c8c-b0093f4de480" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186161967 :knowledge-point/questions "b5303979-3553-5424-8c8c-b0093f4de480"] [:db/add "07a09627-983b-5222-9d9c-54a787ed6c38" :answer/id #uuid "07a09627-983b-5222-9d9c-54a787ed6c38"] [:db/add "07a09627-983b-5222-9d9c-54a787ed6c38" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "07a09627-983b-5222-9d9c-54a787ed6c38" :answer/value "$R_{1}:=R_{1}+4R_{3}$ and $R_{2}:=R_{2}+5R_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "07a09627-983b-5222-9d9c-54a787ed6c38" :answer/validate] [:db/add "26b45609-9cba-5c11-936c-d90a58df59cf" :answer/id #uuid "26b45609-9cba-5c11-936c-d90a58df59cf"] [:db/add "26b45609-9cba-5c11-936c-d90a58df59cf" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "26b45609-9cba-5c11-936c-d90a58df59cf" :answer/value "$R_{1}:=R_{1}-4R_{3}$ and $R_{2}:=R_{2}-R_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "26b45609-9cba-5c11-936c-d90a58df59cf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e0963346-b3ca-5758-9fd0-4a07052df9ee" :answer/id #uuid "e0963346-b3ca-5758-9fd0-4a07052df9ee"] [:db/add "e0963346-b3ca-5758-9fd0-4a07052df9ee"